---
description: Dr Non's anti-slop design rules. Read ANTI-SLOP.md before any UI work.
alwaysApply: true
---

Before designing or changing any page, component, style or chart, read `ANTI-SLOP.md` at the repo root and follow its hard limits: empty space is a decision, subtract before you add, the map comes first. The shared core (ship basics included) is Non-Slop: https://github.com/Nonarkara/Non-Slop. Run `node tools/slop-lint.mjs <url>` and `npx -y github:Nonarkara/Non-Slop render <url>` before calling UI work done.
